irror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Claim your Twitch Drops from your Twitch Drop inventory before (Fri) October 30, 2026 at 23:59 PDT / (Sat) October 31, 2026 at 7:59 CET.</div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\">There will be three campaign periods available. See below:</div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><strong>1. [War For Atreia] Channels:</strong></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Start: October 2, 2026 at 12:00 PDT / October 2, 2026 at 21:00 CEST</div><div data-contents-type=\"text\">End: October 4, 2026 at 23:59 PDT / October 5, 2026 at 8:59 CEST</div><div class=\"tableWrapper\"><table class=\"\"><colgroup><col><col><col></colgroup><tbody><tr><th style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><strong>Watch Time</strong>​</div></th><th style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><strong>Reward</strong>​</div></th><th style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><strong>Qty</strong>​</div></th></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">​<span style=\"color: inherit;\">30 minutes</span></div></td><td style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><span style=\"color: oklch(0.17 0.002 0);\">​</span><span style=\"color: inherit;\">Appearance Change Voucher (Bound)</span></div></td><td style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\">x1</span><span style=\"color: oklch(0.17 0.002 0);\">​</span></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">1 hour</div></td><td style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><span style=\"color: oklch(0.17 0.002 0);\">​</span><span style=\"color: inherit;\">Soul Codex (Bound)</span></div></td><td style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><span style=\"color: oklch(0.17 0.002 0);\">​</span><span style=\"color: inherit;\">x10</span></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">​2<span style=\"color: inherit;\">&nbsp;hour</span></div></td><td style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\">Resurrection Spiritstone (Bound)</span></div></td><td style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\">x10</span></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">4 hour</div></td><td style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\">Mysterious Pet Chest (Bound)</span></div></td><td style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\">x10</span></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><strong>2. [War For Atreia] Channels: October 7 - 9</strong></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Start:&nbsp;October 7, 2026 at 10:00 AM PDT / October 7, 2026 at 19:00 CEST</div><div data-contents-type=\"text\">End:&nbsp;October 9, 2026 at 23:59 PM PDT / October 10, 2026 at 8:59 CEST</div><div class=\"tableWrapper\"><table class=\"\"><colgroup><col><col><col style=\"width: 50px;\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><strong>Watch Time</strong>​</div></th><th style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><strong>Reward</strong>​</div></th><th data-colwidth=\"50\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><strong>Qty</strong>​</div></th></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">​<span style=\"color: inherit;\">30 minutes</span></div></td><td style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\">Customization Voucher (Bound)</span></div></td><td